  "details": "1. Open the VRChat website.\n\n2. Go to a Group.\n\n3. Click Members.\n\n4. Open Filter → Role.\n\n5. Try clicking one of the roles.\n\nIssue:\n\nThe new profile design appears to overlap the Role filter dropdown. When a profile banner/image is positioned underneath or behind the dropdown, it covers the role options and prevents them from being clicked. The filter itself opens normally, but certain role options become unclickable when a profile is in that position.\n\nI've attached a screen recording showing the issue.",
